000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. AIXNATU.
000300* Update a KSDS with two alternate keys, opened I-O: on this VSAM
000400* the paths cannot be open with the base for output, so the program
000500* updates by the prime key and VSAM maintains the indexes -- a WRITE
000600* that duplicates the unique alternate (22), one that duplicates the
000700* other (02), a REWRITE that moves a record to another DEPT, a DELETE.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT AIX-FILE ASSIGN TO AIXBAS
001200         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001300         ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
001400         RECORD KEY IS AIX-KEY
001500         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-DEPT WITH DUPLICATES
001600         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-CODE
001700         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001800 DATA DIVISION.
001900 FILE SECTION.
002000 FD  AIX-FILE
002100     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002200     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002300 01  AIX-RECORD.
002400     02  AIX-KEY                 PIC X(5).
002500     02  FILLER                  PIC X(5).
002600     02  AIX-DEPT                PIC X(3).
002700     02  AIX-CODE                PIC X(4).
002800     02  AIX-TEXT                PIC X(63).
002900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003000 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC XX VALUE '00'.
003100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003200 MAIN-PARA.
003300     OPEN I-O AIX-FILE.
003400     DISPLAY 'OPEN I-O ' WS-STATUS.
003500     MOVE SPACES TO AIX-RECORD.
003600     MOVE 'K0007     DDDC300 dup code' TO AIX-RECORD.
003700     WRITE AIX-RECORD
003800         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE K0007 REFUSED ' WS-STATUS.
003900     MOVE SPACES TO AIX-RECORD.
004000     MOVE 'K0008     AAAC800 dup dept' TO AIX-RECORD.
004100     WRITE AIX-RECORD
004200         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE K0008 REFUSED ' WS-STATUS.
004300     DISPLAY 'WRITE K0008 ' WS-STATUS.
004400     MOVE 'K0001' TO AIX-KEY.
004500     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-KEY
004600         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO K0001'.
004700     PERFORM SHOW.
004800     MOVE 'AAA' TO AIX-DEPT.
004900     REWRITE AIX-RECORD
005000         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'REWRITE REFUSED ' WS-STATUS.
005100     DISPLAY 'REWRITE ' WS-STATUS.
005200     MOVE 'K0005' TO AIX-KEY.
005300     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-KEY
005400         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO K0005'.
005500     PERFORM SHOW.
005600     DELETE AIX-FILE
005700         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'DELETE REFUSED ' WS-STATUS.
005800     DISPLAY 'DELETE ' WS-STATUS.
005900     MOVE 'K0003' TO AIX-KEY.
006000     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-KEY
006100         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO K0003'.
006200     PERFORM NEXT-ONE 2 TIMES.
006300     CLOSE AIX-FILE.
006400     DISPLAY 'CLOSE ' WS-STATUS.
006500     STOP RUN.
008000 NEXT-ONE.
008100     READ AIX-FILE NEXT
008200         AT END DISPLAY 'AT END ' WS-STATUS.
008300     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '10' PERFORM SHOW.
008400 SHOW.
008500     DISPLAY WS-STATUS ' ' AIX-KEY ' ' AIX-DEPT ' ' AIX-CODE.
